<title>USA: Environmental Elements names chairman.</title>
<headline>Environmental Elements names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Environmental Elements Corp said on Wednesday it named E.H. Verdery as chairman.</p>
<p>F. B. Smith, chairman of the board of Environmental Elements Corporation since September 1995, will retire as of March 31, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>Smith will remain on the board as a director and Verdery will add the role of chairman to his continuing role of president and chief executive officer, the company said.</p>
</text>
